```New User Created | MITRE T1136 | every 5 min, last 5 min```
(index=pi_linux sourcetype=linux_secure "new user: name=")
OR (index=macos sourcetype=macos:unified sysadminctl ("Creating user record" OR "addUser"))
| eval device=if(index=="macos","Mac","Pi")
| stats count as events min(_time) as first_seen values(_raw) as details by device
| eval details=mvindex(details,0,2)
| convert ctime(first_seen)
